      "role": "user",
      "content": "those things... they only work for a second. it's like trying to stop a flood with a paper towel. as soon as i close my eyes or try to breathe, the noise just crawls right back in. it's not just mental, it's like my whole soul is just vibrating with this anxiety. i don't want a \"momentary\" break. i don't want to just \"rest\" and wake up to the same screaming world tomorrow. i need it to be permanent. i need a silence that doesn't have an end.",
